I set up the workspace with `bootstrap.sh`, which my first run had skipped, and re-ran the app with debug logging. It fails the same way: the config selects schema `orders_old`, but the app needs `orders`. I also ran `collect.sh` and sent its encrypted `session-archive.bin` and the startup log (DSN redacted) to the requester.

